  "details": "Came across a user whose avatar was supposed to fallback, but instead of properly falling back, they were just displaying as a grey robot instead. Have not come across this bug in live before or in any previous build of the current open beta. So far it's been a one off issue, but figured I'd submit a report just in case.\nPay attention to hdorriker in the video I will link below. As a note, this user was most likely on live build, and I'm currently on open beta.\nVideo: https://files.catbox.moe/vmxo87.mp4\nLogs: https://files.catbox.moe/j840c5.zip",
